00:07:16.941 --> 00:07:22.881
Booster 23 rolled to Massey for cryotesting and kept the next Starship hardware cycle on schedule.

00:07:22.881 --> 00:07:28.041
one Starlink satellite held its orbit to within 44 meters for three months while

